flowchart TB
    A["<b>Upload DOCX</b><br/>What: store immutable source and content hash<br/>Component: ingestion registry<br/>Script: app/service.py"]
    B["<b>Validate OOXML package</b><br/>What: required parts, ZIP integrity, safe paths and resource limits<br/>Component: Python zipfile plus defusedxml<br/>Script: app/extraction/docx_validation.py"]
    C["<b>Inventory Word content</b><br/>What: stories, properties, links, revisions, comments and embedded objects<br/>Component: direct OOXML parsing<br/>Script: app/extraction/docx.py"]

    A -->|"source.docx"| B
    B -->|"validated package inventory"| C

    C -->|"native path"| D["<b>Authoritative native extraction</b><br/>What: headings, paragraphs, content controls, nested tables, links, headers, footers, notes, comments and image anchors<br/>Component: defusedxml OOXML traversal<br/>Script: app/extraction/docx.py"]
    C -->|"visual path"| E["<b>Isolated Writer rendering</b><br/>What: convert DOCX to PDF and render every page without macros or shared profile state<br/>Component: LibreOffice Writer plus PyMuPDF<br/>Script: app/extraction/docx_renderer.py"]

    E -->|"rendered/document.pdf + pages/page-NNNN.png"| F["<b>Native-to-page alignment</b><br/>What: map normalized Word blocks to rendered pages and flag weak matches<br/>Component: deterministic text matching<br/>Script: app/extraction/docx.py"]
    D -->|"native blocks and element inventory"| F

    E -->|"pages/page-NNNN.png"| G["<b>Independent visual extraction</b><br/>What: transcribe page-visible content and describe diagrams, images and layout<br/>Component: configured multimodal LLM<br/>Scripts: app/vision/openai.py or app/vision/ollama.py"]

    F -->|"authoritative page evidence"| H["<b>Deterministic reconciliation</b><br/>What: native facts retain precedence; visual-only meaning is added; conflicts are quarantined<br/>Component: element fusion<br/>Scripts: app/extraction/docx.py and pptx_reconcile.py"]
    G -->|"independent visual evidence"| H

    H -->|"reconciled page evidence"| I["<b>Independent judge</b><br/>What: compare OOXML, rendered page, visual output and reconciliation<br/>Component: configured multimodal judge<br/>Scripts: app/vision/* and app/extraction/pptx_review.py"]
    I -->|"page review decision"| J{"Material discrepancy?"}

    J -->|"No: AUTO_PASS"| K["<b>Finalize normalization</b><br/>What: write common schema with Word inventory, blocks, pages, review and provenance<br/>Component: Pydantic schema and storage<br/>Scripts: app/extraction/models.py and app/storage.py"]
    J -->|"Yes: NEEDS_REVIEW"| L["<b>Human Word-page review</b><br/>What: show material questions grouped by page<br/>Component: common review UI<br/>Scripts: docx_report.py and docx_resolution.py"]
    L -->|"DOCX-WORD-PAGE-REVIEW-REPORT.md + answers"| M["<b>Resolve with AI</b><br/>What: propose corrected page Markdown grounded in the human answer<br/>Component: configured resolver LLM<br/>Scripts: app/service.py and app/vision/*"]
    M -->|"human applies resolution"| K
    K -->|"normalized.json"| N["<b>End of this phase</b><br/>No chunking, embedding or Qdrant indexing"]

